The program's build on the screen: GXPC_SetBuildLabel.

Testers' logs and screenshots did not say which build made them (one tester
ran an older build than the one being tested). The platform layer now gives
sms_gx its version and commit: a line on the overlay's panel, and alone in
the window's lower-left corner for the first seconds of the game.

